{"unit_id":"tag:079X:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n结合引理 <REF_0001>，可知下面的定义对于赋环位点（sites）上的模（modules）层（sheaves）也是“正确的定义”。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"系数模"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"全无上同调的模层"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:072Y:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为位点（site）。称阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）<MATH_0002> 为 <TEXTITOPEN_0001>全无上同调的（totally acyclic）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001><FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>尽管这一术语在 <REF_0001> 中使用，但它可能是非标准记号（notation）。在 <REF_0002> 中，这一性质称为“松弛（flasque）”，但我们不能使用这个词，因为它会与我们对于拓扑空间（topological spaces）上的松弛（flasque）层（sheaves）的定义冲突。如果有更好的建议，请发邮件至 <TEXTOPEN_0001>stacks.project@gmail.com<TEXTCLOSE_0001>。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>，若对每个集合（sets）的层（sheaf）<MATH_0003>，都有 <MATH_0004> 对所有 <MATH_0005> 成立。\n","allowed_english":["stacks","project","gmail","com"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"totally acyclic","target_term":"全无上同调的"},{"source_term":"notation","target_term":"记号"},{"source_term":"flasque","target_term":"松弛"},{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"flasque","target_term":"松弛"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"底层位点"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"定义的对象"},{"source_term":"totally acyclic","target_term":"全无上同调的","context":"所有广义高次上同调消失"},{"source_term":"notation","target_term":"记号","context":"术语命名说明"},{"source_term":"flasque","target_term":"松弛","context":"原文讨论的备选术语"},{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间","context":"旧松弛层定义"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"旧松弛层定义"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"广义取截面对象"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"广义取截面对象"}],"notes":["原文脚注含“is is used”的重复；英文来源原样保留，此处仅记录源文 remark。"]}
{"unit_id":"tag:079X:prose-0003","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n显然，全无上同调性（totally acyclic）是内在性质（intrinsic property），即在拓扑斯（topoi）的等价（equivalences）下保持。全无上同调（totally acyclic）层（sheaf）在该位点（site）的所有对象（objects）上都有消失的高次上同调（cohomology），但一般而言，全无上同调（totally acyclic）的条件严格更强。下面给出全无上同调（totally acyclic）层（sheaves）的一个刻画，有时它很有用。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"totally acyclic","target_term":"全无上同调性"},{"source_term":"intrinsic property","target_term":"内在性质"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"equivalences","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"totally acyclic","target_term":"全无上同调"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"totally acyclic","target_term":"全无上同调"},{"source_term":"totally acyclic","target_term":"全无上同调"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"totally acyclic","target_term":"全无上同调性","context":"定义的不变量"},{"source_term":"intrinsic property","target_term":"内在性质","context":"与位点表示无关"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"等价保持性"},{"source_term":"equivalences","target_term":"等价","context":"拓扑斯等价"},{"source_term":"totally acyclic","target_term":"全无上同调","context":"定义的层性质"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"全无上同调层"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"底层位点"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"取上同调对象"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"局部上同调消失"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"全无上同调层"}],"notes":[]}
